# Test code, not production code. Two checks from the root config are wrong
# here and must stay right everywhere else (R-SAN-02: a suppression carries its
# reason).
#
#   misc-use-internal-linkage
#       A test function is deliberately non-static: test/host/runner.c calls it
#       by name. Making it static would silently stop the test running.
#
#   clang-analyzer-optin.core.EnumCastOutOfRange
#       Casting a value outside the enum is the thing under test - it proves
#       the switch fallthrough handles a value that arrived from outside.
---
InheritParentConfig: true
Checks: >
  -misc-use-internal-linkage,
  -clang-analyzer-optin.core.EnumCastOutOfRange
